      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menyirok ma Ot pa Were ma yuwaŋe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itero Ezekiel i Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma piero ario g'abic ma twec mawan, i cakirok ma oro, i ndelo mar'apar ma dwe, i oro mar'apar g'aŋwen cuka maki tindi madwoŋ, i ndelo no won, cingi Rwoth oyido nitie kwoŋan, aka okelan kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 21:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go okelan i menyirok pa Were, i piny ma Isiraili, to jengan piny wi got mabor swa, m'oyido nitie iye gim'otim ma cal tindi madwoŋ yuthenge ma yupiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo okelan kenyo, jal mogo oyido nitie kenyo, ma cal pere oliel pa ywel. Onwaŋo otiŋo thol ma rapim kodi luth ma rapim i cinge. Aka onwaŋo ocungo yu waŋkac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalo owaco ran ni wod dhano, winji maber aka kaŋasa odoco kisi gimoro je m'akidho nyuthin, rupiri me am'omiyo okelin ka. Waci ri Joisiraili gimoro je m'ineno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waŋkac ma yuwok ceŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
