        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 6:1-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 3:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo oyido nitie kor ot m'othoko woko mar'adec ma Ot pa Were gi paka rom. Boro ma rapim ma kedi m'onwaŋo nitie i cingi jadwoŋ no oyido obedo mita adek, kisi acel adec mita, aka adec acel ma cingi jo; to go pima nywol ma kor ot, kedi acel, ŋawirok mere, gi kedi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kidho yu waŋkac ma ŋiyo yuwok ceŋ, oidho madala mere to pima kadonjo ma waŋkac, kedi acel, lutho mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisika ma thenge, kedi acel mabor kodi kedi acel i laco; gi thwolo ma dier kisikin ma thenge, mita ario g'adec; aka yo nyim waŋkac yu diŋ ma waŋkac macowe iye kodi cel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To pima diŋ ma waŋkac wok i ot, mita aŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go pima waŋkac mere m'oumere, fut apar g'aŋwen kodi sirin mere fut aŋwen kodi waŋkac m'oumere wok yu ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka onwaŋo nitie kisikin adek i kisi thenge ma waŋkac ma yuwok ceŋ; adek me onwaŋo jorom aroma; aka maraba ma kisi thenge onwaŋo romaroma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go pima kendo laco ma yawirok ma waŋkac, mita abic; aka laco ma yu waŋkac, mita aucel g'adec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onwaŋo nitie rageŋ ma fodi ikitundo i kisikin ma yuthenge, adec mita kisi thenge; aka kisikin ma thenge me onwaŋ obedo mita ario i kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To doko pima waŋkac gi yucen ma kisikin ma thenge tundo i yucen ma man, i laco ma mita ario g'adec kodi mita apar; wok i kor ot kiri i kor ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opima bende diŋ mere, mita apar; aka thoko diŋ ma yu waŋkac onwaŋo nitie kapido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yunyim waŋkac i kadonjo mere tundo i gike i diŋ ma iye ma waŋkac onwaŋo romo mita piero ario g'abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikin kodi sirin oyido jonitie gi dirisin gi thigin yuthenge ma yu iye ma waŋkac je thoko, aka diŋ oyido nitie gi dirisin yu iye thoko; aka i wi sirin oyido nitie yen thith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diedipo ma woko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go kelan yuwoko ma kapido; aka neni, oyido nitie kisikin kodi ŋetagola, thoko kapido iye je; kisikin piero adek yunyim ŋetagola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋetagola opimere gi waŋkac, boro mere orom aroma gi waŋkac; me oyido ŋetagola macowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To doko pima boro ma wok i nyim waŋkac macowe tundo woko ma nyim kapido ma iye, mita piero abic.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waŋkac ma yumalo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to go pima waŋkac ma kapido ma yuwoko m'oŋiyo yumalo, boro mere gi laco mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikin adek ma kisi thenge, adek kisi thenge, maraba kodi diŋ mere calacala kodi waŋkac marapena; boro mere mita piero abic, aka laco mere mita apar g'ario g'adec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dirisin, diŋ kodi yen ma thith mere oyido romaroma paka ma waŋkac ma ŋiyere gi ma yuwok ceŋ; tiendi jo abirio tund'iye; aka diŋ mere nitie i iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yunyim waŋkac ma yumalo, paka ma yuwok ceŋ, oyido nitie waŋkac ma kapido ma iye, to pima wok waŋkac kiri i waŋkac, mita piero abic.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waŋkac ma yupiny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
