        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go okelan yupiny, aka neni, waŋkac yupiny; to pima maraba kodi diŋ mere; je jo rom paka wadi. Aka onwaŋo nitie dirisin, aka i diŋ mere, paka dirisin ma man; boro mere mita piero ario g'abic, to laco mere mita apar g'ario g'adec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie dirisin thoko i iye je aka i diŋ mere, paka dirisin ma man mere. Boro paka rom ma dhiot ma waŋkac oyido obedo fut piero aboro g'aŋwen aka laco fut piero aŋwen g'ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie madala ma tiendi jo abirio tundo i iye; aka diŋ mere oyido nitie i iye, aka nitie yen ma thith yunyime, acel kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie waŋkac yupiny ma kapido ma iye; to go pima wok i waŋkac tundo i waŋkac yuthenge ma yupiny, fut miya acel gi piero aucel g'aboro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diedipo ma iye: Waŋkac ma yupiny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
