          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go opima kapido, oyido obedo fut miya acel gi piero aucel g'aboro thenge aŋwen je marom aroma. Aka migam oyido nitie yuwaŋ Ot pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kelan i diŋ ma Ot pa Were to pima siro ma diŋ, obedo fut abuŋwen i lutho kodi fut piero ario g'aŋwen i laco, i kisi thenge; aka kor thengi waŋkac oyido obedo fut abic ma nywol i kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boro ma diŋ oyido obedo fut piero adek g'aŋwen i laco kodi fut piero ario i lutho; tiendi jo apar tund'iye; sirin oyido nitie iye, i kisi thengi sirin yu kisi thenge acel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.49"
            ]
          }
